window.docContents[83].resolve({"/5___-Representations-of-finite-groups___-Further-results/5___13___-Proof-of-the-classification-theorem-for-representations-of-___S_n___/Proof-of-Theorem-5___12___2-using-Lemmas-5___13___1-5___13___4/#Chapter5___Discussion_proof_of_Theorem5___12___2":{"contents":"Now we are ready to prove Theorem 5.12.2. Let \\lambda \\geq \\mu. Then by Lemmas 5.13.3 and 5.13.4\n\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{S_n}(V_\\lambda, V_\\mu) = \\operatorname{Hom}_{S_n}(\\mathbb{C}[S_n]c_\\lambda, \\mathbb{C}[S_n]c_\\mu) = c_\\lambda \\mathbb{C}[S_n] c_\\mu.\n\nThe latter space is zero for \\lambda > \\mu by Lemma 5.13.2 and 1-dimensional if \\lambda = \\mu by Lemmas 5.13.1 and 5.13.3. Therefore, V_\\lambda are irreducible, and V_\\lambda is not isomorphic to V_\\mu if \\lambda \\neq \\mu. Since the number of partitions equals the number of conjugacy classes in S_n, the representations V_\\lambda exhaust all the irreducible representations of S_n. The theorem is proved.\n\n\n\n","context":"Introduction to Representation Theory\t5. Representations of finite groups: Further results\t5.13. Proof of the classification theorem for representations of $S_n$\tProof of Theorem 5.12.2 using Lemmas 5.13.1-5.13.4","header":"Proof of Theorem 5.12.2 using Lemmas 5.13.1-5.13.4","id":"/5___-Representations-of-finite-groups___-Further-results/5___13___-Proof-of-the-classification-theorem-for-representations-of-___S_n___/Proof-of-Theorem-5___12___2-using-Lemmas-5___13___1-5___13___4/#Chapter5___Discussion_proof_of_Theorem5___12___2"},"/9___-Structure-of-finite-dimensional-algebras/9___1___-Lifting-of-idempotents/Section-9___1___-Lifting-of-idempotents/#Chapter9___Introduction_9___1___heading-1":{"contents":"Let A be a ring, and let I \\subset A be a nilpotent ideal.\n\n\n","context":"Introduction to Representation Theory\t9. Structure of finite dimensional algebras\t9.1. Lifting of idempotents\tSection 9.1: Lifting of idempotents","header":"9.1. Lifting of idempotents","id":"/9___-Structure-of-finite-dimensional-algebras/9___1___-Lifting-of-idempotents/Section-9___1___-Lifting-of-idempotents/#Chapter9___Introduction_9___1___heading-1"}});
